            <ArticleTitle>Investigation of antifungal and analgesic activities of extracts from Sium nodiflorum.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>105-10</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Different extracts of aerial parts of Sium nodiflorum were examined for their antifungal activity against two groups of fungi: the growth of both yeast and mold was significantly inhibited. Analgesic activity study of these extracts was also carried out but showed no significant effect in mice on the writhing induced by acetic acid.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
